      "code": "            for(int i=0;i<7;i++) { ",
      "explanation": "the first loop starts with i = 0. i increases 1 for each iteration and terminates while i reaches 7."
    },
    {
      "line_no": 6,
      "code": "                for(int j=7;j>i;j--) { ",
      "explanation": "the second for loop will be completely executed for each repetition of the enclosing for loop, and each time the enclosing loop variable 'i' will \r\nhave an incremented value. The first time, 'i' will be 0 and 'j' will start form 7 and will decrement in each step down to 1 (condition is j>i), \r\nrepeating a total of 7 times. Next time, 'i' will be 1 and this inner for loop will repeat from j=7 to j=2 (6 times)."
